4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=x6FXj7UN8r0Q7kNvwGeFeqY&_nc_oc=Adq_Rv9lEovDnA3ttAfcKRFoM7k0FUGTyXQ9odKta_cQTVRVB_U6puuCV5Vz_kuot-c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL1TGspeP8OljbUpofWVr9erzvSy6OH-Vl5u1AsEnhfJg&oe=6AA2AAD4"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWhBVfVkhKgQ7kNvwEaJyd1&_nc_oc=AdqzmXXZRHXxdQvUuo66DPS8zeNWK-8MKTAnOfJKkUYv9oXGhASgt2Jswxl8dvie1-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIRWegrM261-VaGP0y8PRlHzZdmAxpwIerWsW4za1YVPg&oe=6AA2AFB2"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZHS6CZ6dr54Q7kNvwEawLM2&_nc_oc=AdqqkgwEcy_c3U565NW6VzB9YoCb1MBmOTEiCd6jSrSGB8i2hGVBPaOre9L88QM9qJE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIaTMuBApxHCs9dxIcE-HuLlbK09bvPKadOlJ-vaMtfrw&oe=6AA2BD55"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p